beam to a very small spot,

00:42:19.020 --> 00:42:21.600
and they look at-- because
of the wavelengths,

00:42:21.600 --> 00:42:23.590
depends on the momentum.

00:42:23.590 --> 00:42:26.090
So the higher voltage,
the shorter wavelengths.

00:42:26.090 --> 00:42:28.910
So you can look
