00:43:04.280 --> 00:43:07.010
So that the electron can
go through the sample.

00:43:07.010 --> 00:43:08.690
You look at the other side.

00:43:08.690 --> 00:43:10.430
So that's transmission.

00:43:10.430 --> 00:43:14.600
And SEM is, your
