00:55:39.260 --> 00:55:40.900
So it's the kinetic
energy divided

00:55:40.900 --> 00:55:43.100
or plus the potential energy.

00:55:43.100 --> 00:55:46.930
So is 2m, that's
a kinetic energy,

00:55:46.930 --> 00:55:49.910
plus the potential energy.

00:55:49.910 --> 00:55:53.400
And now, the p is operator.

00:55:53.400 --> 00:55:58.820
So if you do your,
