00:56:30.050 --> 00:56:35.510
This is the kinetic
energy, potential energy.

00:56:35.510 --> 00:56:37.220
And that's what we have there.

00:56:43.330 --> 00:56:46.930
Now let's look at
the first thing

00:56:46.930 --> 00:56:50.035
