01:01:50.310 --> 01:01:59.590
It's a potential that this
matter wave, electrons, atoms,

01:01:59.590 --> 01:02:01.600
what's the constraint.

01:02:01.600 --> 01:02:04.300
They're constrained by
different potentials.

01:02:04.300 --> 01:02:07.030
And there's different potential
give you different energy

01:02:07.030 --> 01:02:08.965
state of the matter.

